  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ION Financiera</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to support ION&#x2019;s first long-term corporate bond issuance of Mex$200 million in Mexico. This issuance is part of ION&#x2019;s Mex$500 million corporate bond issuance program to be registered in the Mexican Stock Exchange. The project will support ION&#x2019;s strategy to: (i) expand its SME lending portfolio; and (ii) extend its funding tenors and diversify funding sources by tapping capital markets and reaching a new base of investors. IIC&#x2019;s participation will strengthen ION&#x2019;s business plan of increasing its SME lending portfolio from Mex$30 million in 2016 to Mex$285 million in 2021.</narrative>
  </description>
